WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.250
Drive Impact connects while Dhalsim is on the left of Ryu.

2
00:00:02.250 --> 00:00:02.580
Dhalsim appears in the air on Ryu’s right after the teleport.

3
00:00:02.580 --> 00:00:02.900
The jumping light kick connects from the new side as Dhalsim descends.

4
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:03.500
Standing heavy kick launches Ryu toward the left side of the screen.

5
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:04.000
Dhalsim releases light Yoga Fire toward the airborne opponent.

6
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:04.190
Ryu rises on the left with the light fireball beside him; Dhalsim has completed the side switch to the right.
